{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2017-biology-21","exam":"MDEET","year":2017,"subject":"biology","number":21,"points":4,"unitId":"genetics","unitLabel":"유전학","topic":"표현형·교배","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["genetics"],"stem":"다음은초파리에서3 가지형질의유전에대한실험이다.\n(가) 긴날개, 갈색몸, 붉은눈의초파리(P)를자가교배하여\n1600마리의F1을얻는다.\n(나) F1의암수를구분하여표현형에따라개체수를구한다.\n암수\n표현형\n개체수(마리)\n긴날개, 갈색몸, 붉은눈\n600\n암컷\n긴날개, 노란몸, 붉은눈\n200\n긴날개, 갈색몸, 붉은눈\n300\n긴날개, 노란몸, 붉은눈\n100\n수컷\n흔적날개, 갈색몸, 흰눈\n300\n㉠흔적날개, 노란몸, 흰눈\n100\n(다) ㉠의초파리를P의암컷초파리와교배하여F2를얻는다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것만을<보기>에서있는대로고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 몸색깔과눈색깔을결정하는유전자가연관되어있다.\nㄴ. 날개길이를결정하는유전자가X 염색체상에있다.\nㄷ. F2에서긴날개, 갈색몸, 붉은눈의초파리수＝3\n이다.\n흔적날개, 노란몸, 흰눈의초파리수","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t030"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":775,"height":592,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,29.948,310.0,236.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-21/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":246,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,319.148,310.4,98.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-21/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":8,"sourceRect":[82.744,151.652,416.5,599.591],"width":333.756,"height":447.939,